  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The contribution is about consultancy support services to the Embassy in Tirana in mapping out needs, opportunities and actors for Sida future engagement in contributing to a stronger enviromental civil society. The aim is to continue the support to the Albanian ECSOs based on the good results and experiences and lessons learnt from previous programme (known as SENiOR).</narrative>
